 17592186045436 true] [17592186481022 1080 "Compute $A^2=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=A$ by row-column multiplication. For example the first row is $(4-2,0,4-2)=(2,0,2)$; the second is $(2+1-2,1,2+2-2)=(1,1,2)$; the third is $(-2+1,0,-2+1)=(-1,0,-1)$. Therefore A satisfies the definition." 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481022 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481022 1083 #uuid "98f5f650-3ea2-570c-bff3-63ce1fdd29b6" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481023 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481023 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481023 1083 #uuid "9e3db64e-2baa-59dd-be20-cff08d3be78b" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481024 1080 "a+d=0,\\quad b,c\\in\\mathbb R" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481024 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481024 1083 #uuid "9f69788b-5c55-5eeb-a6d8-a99c5490d258" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481025 1080 "Every coefficient column must be a pivot column, since any nonpivot coefficient column gives a free variable. The last (augmented) column must not be a pivot column, since that would produce an inconsistent row. Zero rows are allowed when the system has more equations than variables." 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481025 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481025 1083 #uuid "9fb4d97d-3769-5eda-b87a-20158d936fca" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481026 1080 "\\{(x_0,y_0)\\in\\mathbb R^2:y_0\\ne-1,\\ y_0\\ne1\\}" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481026 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [17592186481026 1083 #uuid "a130a1ef-515c-50c7-a8e8-b243a679aee8" 13194139535218 17592186045436 true] [1759218